[{:db/id "q-38063/selection/1af3f463dc33f68641ee65190bf994e6c4fdf5273adf6a9e23d82cd4b60584fc" :answer/id #uuid "1409b4b7-07f9-5b67-83c9-b4ab0bdcbc7d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}=kt,\\,\\,k>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38063/selection/5536274e6cb969a1e5dcc7f6b2d0c8aeaca873915f3b452bbd445a6b0c37d6a0" :answer/id #uuid "8286a81c-ec59-52e1-9ed9-c8ce2c1953a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}=k{v}^{2},\\,\\,k>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38063/selection/87c06dc448d0f8c679d5126fbaf46517ff945efeb2f88e498856d2f0a5768e67" :answer/id #uuid "00f48e47-279f-5def-940a-8d40692286ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}=kv,\\,\\,k>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38063/selection/efbaf02e28eeccda5b503f965de2252c104a42c1fa5c8a95fba9214b04c056ba" :answer/id #uuid "18dd537a-af28-5c07-bedd-7a4b36ed88c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}=-kt,\\,\\,k>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38063/selection/b6ac425e2f248fbb4c28b0aaa15b9b08347584f0c9e089e2c1197c4e5a4a8992" :answer/id #uuid "7da77f64-01ad-5ac3-a53f-bf4c1bb18337" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}=-kv,\\,\\,k>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38063/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1ece2767-21cf-5add-9ade-9d6a7a5599f0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-38063/selection/b6ac425e2f248fbb4c28b0aaa15b9b08347584f0c9e089e2c1197c4e5a4a8992" :answer-field/choices ["q-38063/selection/1af3f463dc33f68641ee65190bf994e6c4fdf5273adf6a9e23d82cd4b60584fc" "q-38063/selection/5536274e6cb969a1e5dcc7f6b2d0c8aeaca873915f3b452bbd445a6b0c37d6a0" "q-38063/selection/87c06dc448d0f8c679d5126fbaf46517ff945efeb2f88e498856d2f0a5768e67" "q-38063/selection/efbaf02e28eeccda5b503f965de2252c104a42c1fa5c8a95fba9214b04c056ba" "q-38063/selection/b6ac425e2f248fbb4c28b0aaa15b9b08347584f0c9e089e2c1197c4e5a4a8992"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-38063" :question/id #uuid "307b1396-bf2f-5c6f-b4f9-47e505860659" :question/math-academy-id "q-38063" :question/problem "The velocity $v$ of a merry-go-round decreases at a rate that is proportional to the velocity at that moment. What differential equation describes the rate of change of the velocity at time $t?$" :question/worked-solution "Let's highlight the important words in the given statement:\n\n*The **velocity** $v$ of a merry-go-round **decreases** at a **rate** that is **proportional** to the **velocity** at the moment.* \n\nWe note the following:\n\n- The question describes the *rate* at which the *velocity* of a merry-go-round \nvaries. Therefore, this is a statement about the quantity \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}.\n$$\n\n- We're told that $\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}$ is *proportional to* the *velocity.* In other words,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}∝v.\n$$\n\nRecall that $∝$ means \"is proportional to.\"\n\n- Finally, we want to replace the proportionality symbol with an equality symbol. Let $k$ be a positive constant. Since the velocity *decreases* with time, our derivative should be *negative*. Therefore, we can rewrite our proportionality statement as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}=-kv.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-38063/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "255dee12-5f44-536b-b679-5a894843395d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-38063"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
